WEBVTT

00:02.627 --> 00:05.296
<i>It was a road that required me
to reclaim so many things.</i>

00:07.048 --> 00:09.676
<i>A bloodline created by greed.</i>

00:09.759 --> 00:10.969
<i>And my past.</i>

00:12.345 --> 00:14.556
<i>By the time I came to that realization,</i>

00:14.639 --> 00:17.017
<i>I thought everyone would be far ahead,</i>

00:17.726 --> 00:20.020
<i>unlike me who had been unable to move on.</i>

00:22.522 --> 00:23.523
<i>But...</i>

00:24.691 --> 00:26.609
<i>all of them were right there, all along.</i>

00:31.322 --> 00:32.157
<i>Class A</i>

00:32.991 --> 00:34.409
<i>never left anyone behind.</i>

00:36.953 --> 00:39.039
<i>They always reassured me.</i>

00:40.623 --> 00:41.833
Store and release.

00:42.542 --> 00:44.085
It's concentrated power.

00:44.919 --> 00:46.004
<i>Store...</i>

01:06.024 --> 01:08.818
We will mingle. I'll make sure of it.

01:10.737 --> 01:11.654
So...

01:12.739 --> 01:13.990
please stop.

01:16.242 --> 01:18.036
Great Glacial Aegir.

01:30.048 --> 01:33.885
ORIGINAL STORY BY KOHEI HORIKOSHI

03:19.657 --> 03:21.868
He's down.

03:22.619 --> 03:25.330
Dabi is down!

03:29.334 --> 03:31.085
It must have been really tough...

03:31.169 --> 03:34.130
but he still did it.

03:34.839 --> 03:37.258
He defeated the Blueflame!

03:37.342 --> 03:38.509
Shoto!

03:38.593 --> 03:39.969
We have to keep up with Shoto!

03:41.512 --> 03:43.890
We just need to take this thing down!

03:44.474 --> 03:45.892
Take him down with all we've got!

03:45.975 --> 03:47.393
There's more of us in number!

03:47.477 --> 03:48.811
Get him!

03:50.396 --> 03:51.564
Seems like we can do it.

03:51.648 --> 03:55.318
Yeah. We got lucky with this group.

03:55.902 --> 03:57.487
<i>If we had Kunieda, Gashly,</i>

03:57.570 --> 03:59.447
<i>and the escaped convicts from Tartarus,</i>

03:59.530 --> 04:01.074
<i>we would've been in trouble.</i>

04:01.157 --> 04:02.909
Since we got lucky,

04:02.992 --> 04:05.328
we have to share our luck with others.

04:05.912 --> 04:07.538
A report from the Kamino Team.

04:07.622 --> 04:09.916
Shoto took down Dabi and his Blueflame.

04:09.999 --> 04:12.001
Wow!

04:12.085 --> 04:14.879
All right!

04:18.466 --> 04:19.968
Young Todoroki!

04:21.761 --> 04:22.929
Although

04:23.596 --> 04:27.058
<i>we started off with Midoriya unexpectedly
transporting to the wrong location,</i>

04:28.393 --> 04:31.104
this is an auspicious victory.

04:31.187 --> 04:33.690
Please spread the good news, All Might.

04:35.775 --> 04:37.318
Good job,

04:37.402 --> 04:39.612
Young Todoroki.

04:45.493 --> 04:46.369
UA COFFIN IN THE SKY, OKUTO ISLAND
GUNGA MOUNTAIN VILLA, CENTRAL HOSPITAL

04:46.452 --> 04:49.539
<i>The report from Ground Zero
in the Kamino Ward</i>

04:49.622 --> 04:51.749
<i>reached Headquarters, where Tsukauchi is,</i>

04:51.833 --> 04:54.377
<i>and it was communicated
to all the other locations.</i>

04:54.460 --> 04:55.962
JAKU HOSPITAL RUINS

04:56.045 --> 04:57.714
FRONT OF GIGANTOMACHIA'S
DETAINMENT FACILITY

04:57.797 --> 04:59.632
Acid Shot!

05:04.220 --> 05:05.805
Todoroki won!

05:05.888 --> 05:07.432
All right!

05:08.141 --> 05:10.018
He doesn't disappoint.

05:10.601 --> 05:12.145
And I won't either.

05:20.236 --> 05:23.281
That kid has a soft side to him,
so I was a little worried.

05:23.364 --> 05:25.533
But I guess there was no need for that!
Love him!

05:27.076 --> 05:28.536
This was a surprise attack!

05:29.579 --> 05:32.623
Why are all of these guys here?

05:35.543 --> 05:37.962
<i>They took advantage
of the intel about our raid.</i>

05:38.838 --> 05:41.466
<i>The Heroes made it seem like they were
scattered about,</i>

05:41.549 --> 05:44.260
<i>but dozens of them were stationed here</i>

05:44.343 --> 05:46.512
<i>to defend and protect this site.</i>

05:47.555 --> 05:50.141
<i>One of our most powerful forces</i>

05:50.224 --> 05:51.934
<i>and All For One's trusted servant,</i>

05:52.018 --> 05:53.519
<i>Gigantomachia.</i>

05:54.270 --> 05:58.024
<i>The Heroes must have found out that we,
the detached force, would try</i>

05:58.107 --> 06:00.526
<i>to reclaim our powerful force
during this attack.</i>

06:01.694 --> 06:03.821
<i>But they just wasted their resources.</i>

06:04.614 --> 06:07.533
<i>Now is the generation of liberation!</i>

06:08.659 --> 06:10.745
<i>Anyone who spouts distorted lies</i>

06:11.329 --> 06:12.580
<i>will be trampled upon,</i>

06:14.791 --> 06:17.794
<i>just like that teacher at UA.</i>

06:25.676 --> 06:26.761
I got her!

06:28.513 --> 06:29.931
Sorry I'm late.

06:30.014 --> 06:31.307
Red!

06:31.390 --> 06:33.059
Our task to "guard" is complete.

06:33.768 --> 06:35.895
Pinky! Everyone! Let's do this!

06:37.688 --> 06:39.899
Our Todoroki showed us what a man he is!

06:41.442 --> 06:43.027
We will protect

06:43.778 --> 06:45.571
this defensive line at all costs!

06:48.116 --> 06:49.909
UA COFFIN IN THE SKY, OKUTO ISLAND
GUNGA MOUNTAIN VILLA, CENTRAL HOSPITAL

06:49.992 --> 06:51.244
TAKOBA NATIONAL STADIUM

06:51.953 --> 06:54.914
TAKOBA NATIONAL STADIUM

06:54.997 --> 06:56.958
Todoroki did it!

06:57.041 --> 07:00.628
We'll have to congratulate him
when we finish this battle.

07:00.711 --> 07:02.588
During the Battle Trial, he said...

07:03.339 --> 07:04.215
Sorry,

07:05.049 --> 07:06.801
I'm just on a completely different level.

07:08.386 --> 07:10.388
It reminds me of that time.

07:11.639 --> 07:14.767
COFFIN IN THE SKY

07:22.316 --> 07:24.735
I wouldn't have expected anything less,
Todoroki!

07:25.319 --> 07:26.571
TEMPORARY FORTRESS "TROY"

07:26.654 --> 07:27.780
All right!

07:28.489 --> 07:29.991
Shoto did it!

07:30.825 --> 07:32.535
I see.

07:33.119 --> 07:34.620
Judging by the groupings,

07:34.704 --> 07:36.456
<i>those cages were used</i>

07:36.539 --> 07:40.501
<i>to prioritize the separation
of the most powerful villains.</i>

07:41.127 --> 07:43.045
And as for the other minor villains,

07:43.129 --> 07:45.548
we are to be dealt with here on site, huh?

07:46.132 --> 07:48.551
Is that plan based on trust?

07:48.634 --> 07:50.511
Or is it hope?

07:50.595 --> 07:51.971
Invisible things such as that

07:52.054 --> 07:55.808
are like suffocating film
covering this planet.

07:55.892 --> 07:59.812
What? Are you an alien or something?
Did you say, "this planet"?

07:59.896 --> 08:02.064
I'm talking about being useful
or being in harm.

08:03.065 --> 08:06.736
No one who has tried to deceive that man

08:06.819 --> 08:09.071
has survived to tell the tale.

08:09.780 --> 08:12.200
There are no exceptions allowed.

08:12.783 --> 08:17.580
<i>Due to the failure by Dictator,
my turn never came.</i>

08:17.663 --> 08:20.082
But now, I can prove my usefulness

08:20.708 --> 08:24.504
to All For One right here, right now.

08:24.587 --> 08:27.840
All the "other villains"
will be hunting for your life.

08:27.924 --> 08:30.301
The "Bat of Aesop",

08:30.384 --> 08:32.720
Yuga Aoyama.

08:34.472 --> 08:35.640
<i>Merci.</i>

08:36.724 --> 08:39.519
FRONT OF CENTRAL HOSPITAL

08:43.523 --> 08:46.609
- Whoa!
- Birds?

08:56.953 --> 09:00.540
Shoto took down Dabi!

09:01.290 --> 09:03.209
He was placed with a cruel obligation,

09:03.292 --> 09:05.711
but he fought head-on.

09:05.795 --> 09:07.171
And he fulfilled his task.

09:08.256 --> 09:11.133
He was able to...
stop Dabi, his older brother.

09:11.759 --> 09:13.344
Dabi...

09:13.427 --> 09:15.388
Dabi lost?

09:16.222 --> 09:17.640
That's impossible.

09:18.182 --> 09:20.059
This is information warfare.

09:20.893 --> 09:24.897
It's a lie! I'm... sure of it!

09:25.898 --> 09:27.650
Extra Quirk?

09:29.151 --> 09:31.279
I don't need that.

09:32.822 --> 09:35.366
<i>He has everything.</i>

09:35.950 --> 09:38.661
<i>The reason to live, purpose,</i>

09:39.245 --> 09:40.705
<i>and power.</i>

09:40.788 --> 09:43.708
<i>He has everything I don't have.</i>

09:43.791 --> 09:46.794
Iguchi, as leader of the heteromorphs,

09:47.670 --> 09:50.798
you need power that befits that role.

09:50.881 --> 09:52.675
I will give you extra power.

09:53.884 --> 09:54.719
<i>I...</i>

09:55.845 --> 09:57.638
<i>don't have anything.</i>

10:06.731 --> 10:12.653
His determination
would never allow him to lose!

10:13.404 --> 10:16.282
Rescue Kurogiri who is captured here!

10:16.365 --> 10:18.117
To break free of this society

10:18.200 --> 10:21.120
and for the sake of Shigaraki
and all of us.

10:21.787 --> 10:24.040
In order to destroy everything

10:24.123 --> 10:27.168
that has oppressed us!

10:32.632 --> 10:33.716
<i>Todoroki,</i>

10:35.051 --> 10:36.969
<i>I'm so proud that I was able to be</i>

10:38.095 --> 10:39.847
<i>in the same class as you.</i>

10:41.057 --> 10:43.392
KANAGAWA PREFECTURE KAMINO WARD

10:53.069 --> 10:55.905
Your engine stalled, right?

10:58.074 --> 10:59.617
Sorry.

11:03.621 --> 11:06.666
Why are you apologizing?

11:08.751 --> 11:10.419
How is it

11:10.503 --> 11:12.922
that he's still alive?

11:26.018 --> 11:28.729
UA COFFIN IN THE SKY, OKUTO ISLAND
GUNGA MOUNTAIN VILLA, CENTRAL HOSPITAL

11:28.813 --> 11:30.773
GUNGA MOUNTAIN VILLA

11:31.440 --> 11:34.026
GUNGA MOUNTAIN VILLA

11:34.777 --> 11:37.279
Shoto took down Toya...

11:38.364 --> 11:39.865
Once you're done crying, get up.

11:40.616 --> 11:42.910
Let's all go and stop Toya.

11:45.871 --> 11:47.331
Shoto.

11:47.915 --> 11:49.125
Endeavor.

11:49.208 --> 11:51.377
What's with that face?

11:51.460 --> 11:53.963
Is it affection? Sadness?

11:54.046 --> 11:56.549
Don't listen to him, Endeavor!

11:56.632 --> 11:59.385
You chose to ignore Toya

11:59.468 --> 12:03.055
and forced your greed onto Shoto.

12:03.139 --> 12:06.684
You ruined the lives
of two of your own sons.

12:07.351 --> 12:08.978
That was your decision.

12:09.687 --> 12:11.230
I'm sure

12:11.313 --> 12:14.483
you're trying to justify your mistakes
by being here like this,

12:14.567 --> 12:18.279
by saying that heroes have
so many things to protect.

12:18.362 --> 12:19.989
<i>He's trying to provoke us.</i>

12:20.072 --> 12:21.782
That's why

12:22.575 --> 12:24.535
you lose,

12:24.618 --> 12:27.079
Number One!

12:28.164 --> 12:29.457
<i>All For One</i>

12:30.166 --> 12:32.001
has an obvious weakness.

12:32.084 --> 12:34.920
It's his mask, which is also
his life support system.

12:35.004 --> 12:36.255
It's pretty obvious.

12:37.381 --> 12:39.800
<i>The data we received from Stain
after the prison break</i>

12:39.884 --> 12:41.886
<i>showed him moving with the machine.</i>

12:41.969 --> 12:43.012
<i>It's safe to assume</i>

12:43.095 --> 12:45.639
<i>that he can't function
without that life support system.</i>

12:46.307 --> 12:49.894
I'm sure
he's very much aware of that himself.

12:49.977 --> 12:52.563
It's logical to overwhelm him
with sheer numbers,

12:52.646 --> 12:56.025
but he has the ability to steal Quirks.

12:56.108 --> 12:59.361
We can't allow him to use
our precious fighters to power himself up.

13:00.446 --> 13:03.365
That's why Number One and I...

13:06.452 --> 13:09.580
will be the mighty small force
that takes him down!

13:09.663 --> 13:11.832
Let's do this, Endeavor.

13:11.916 --> 13:12.833
I'm ready.

13:13.417 --> 13:15.085
So mean of you to ignore me.

13:15.169 --> 13:16.462
Endeavor.

13:17.588 --> 13:19.548
Hell Curtain!

13:24.094 --> 13:25.346
You've been...

13:26.847 --> 13:28.182
so conspicuous.

13:28.849 --> 13:31.602
<i>You're the man who used to be too fast.</i>

13:32.436 --> 13:35.856
Even Recovery Girl couldn't heal you
back to your former glory.

13:35.940 --> 13:38.651
You have to use prosthetic feathers
as reinforcement,

13:38.734 --> 13:41.111
and even then,
this is the fastest you can be.

13:41.195 --> 13:43.113
We both have to deal
with disabilities, huh?

13:45.866 --> 13:48.536
<i>We must prevent the fighters below
from getting affected</i>

13:48.619 --> 13:51.956
<i>by the wide-range shock wave
that previously took out Kamino.</i>

13:52.039 --> 13:55.000
<i>I won't distance myself too much
and will finish him off in close combat.</i>

13:55.084 --> 13:57.878
<i>But I can't let him touch me!</i>

13:59.088 --> 14:00.631
Vanishing

14:01.840 --> 14:03.259
Fist!

14:05.344 --> 14:08.305
<i>This heat is seeping through
my Hardflame Fan.</i>

14:08.389 --> 14:11.559
<i>I can't reflect it with the Impact Recoil.</i>

14:11.642 --> 14:12.851
<i>And...</i>

14:15.479 --> 14:18.524
<i>Hawks is denying me the chance
to counterattack.</i>

14:19.108 --> 14:21.110
You know what, Hawks?

14:23.195 --> 14:25.781
Your timing is slightly off.

14:26.407 --> 14:29.410
It seems like Endeavor is
being a little lackluster.

14:30.494 --> 14:32.246
Hawks, we're going to keep this up!

14:32.329 --> 14:34.164
He's feeling the damage for sure!

14:34.248 --> 14:36.333
There's no sign
of Super Regeneration either!

14:40.671 --> 14:42.172
Endeavor,

14:42.840 --> 14:44.592
everyone is fighting desperately

14:44.675 --> 14:47.803
in order to fulfill their role.

14:47.887 --> 14:49.763
The young rookies and everyone else

14:49.847 --> 14:51.932
are earnestly fighting
the battles in front of them,

14:52.016 --> 14:55.185
so how can you allow your heart
to be distracted?

14:56.228 --> 14:58.397
<i>Your masterpiece got rid</i>

14:58.480 --> 15:00.024
<i>of your failed project, right?</i>

15:00.107 --> 15:02.610
You should be happy!

15:03.235 --> 15:04.486
Shut up!

15:04.570 --> 15:08.699
Don't let him provoke you!
Remember All Might at Kamino!

15:09.283 --> 15:10.868
<i>Tomura Shigaraki</i>

15:10.951 --> 15:13.454
<i>is Nana Shimura's grandson.</i>

15:15.456 --> 15:17.958
<i>Isn't it funny, All Might?</i>

15:18.042 --> 15:20.628
<i>Why aren't you smiling?</i>

15:20.711 --> 15:25.341
- Don't let him get to you!
- I've always paid attention

15:25.424 --> 15:29.511
to your warped desire for power.

15:30.387 --> 15:33.307
<i>The thing about me is,
whenever I see fertile soil,</i>

15:33.390 --> 15:36.143
<i>I can't help but sow seeds in it.</i>

15:37.519 --> 15:38.979
You couldn't find

15:39.772 --> 15:41.815
Toya's body, right?

15:44.735 --> 15:46.236
That's right.

15:46.320 --> 15:48.739
<i>There's no way you would've found it.</i>

15:48.822 --> 15:50.240
<i>But you were able to reunite</i>

15:50.324 --> 15:52.534
with your son, who you thought had died.

15:52.618 --> 15:55.371
You should be thanking me.

15:56.497 --> 15:57.331
<i>He still</i>

15:57.915 --> 15:59.833
<i>had such a dirty card to play?</i>

16:01.001 --> 16:03.087
<i>Someone who has given his life to atone</i>

16:03.170 --> 16:07.466
<i>can't make a clean break the way I did.</i>

16:08.175 --> 16:10.177
<i>There was no way this man</i>

16:10.260 --> 16:11.971
<i>could have fought and won against Dabi.</i>

16:14.306 --> 16:18.394
<i>That's why I'm here to support him!</i>

16:18.477 --> 16:22.898
Your mission right now
is to swiftly defeat All For One

16:22.982 --> 16:24.149
with a cool head!

16:26.527 --> 16:30.072
All For One!

16:31.949 --> 16:33.450
Here's my chance!

16:36.412 --> 16:37.871
Endeavor!

16:39.540 --> 16:42.584
Can you dodge my blast from this distance,

16:43.252 --> 16:45.337
Nagant's Replacement?

16:45.421 --> 16:46.797
<i>I can't dodge it.</i>

16:46.880 --> 16:47.923
<i>In that case,</i>

16:48.007 --> 16:49.049
<i>I can save Endeavor,</i>

16:49.133 --> 16:52.011
<i>who can use Prominence Burn.</i>

16:56.348 --> 16:57.850
Hawks!

17:04.273 --> 17:06.692
Hey, try to keep steady!

17:06.775 --> 17:08.777
I'm not used to flying!

17:08.861 --> 17:10.029
I'm freaking out here!

17:10.112 --> 17:12.072
Do your best, Earphone Jack!

17:12.156 --> 17:14.783
And if possible,
try to not wiggle your butt.

17:15.492 --> 17:17.786
- It's making my heart flutter.
- Idiot!

17:17.870 --> 17:19.913
Tsukuyomi!

17:19.997 --> 17:21.665
And she's from Class A...

17:21.749 --> 17:22.791
Don't come here!

17:22.875 --> 17:24.918
This is no place for you guys!
You'll get killed!

17:25.002 --> 17:27.421
We can't take Endeavor's place,

17:27.504 --> 17:28.672
but I can

17:29.256 --> 17:30.507
work with you as a team.

17:31.216 --> 17:34.762
You little flying bugs
swarming around All For One.

17:34.845 --> 17:37.598
I once read in a comic

17:37.681 --> 17:40.184
about a side-character who only existed

17:40.267 --> 17:42.102
to serve as a foil for the Demon King.

17:42.811 --> 17:43.979
Why don't you save that speech

17:44.605 --> 17:48.317
for when you actually defeat us,
All For One?

17:48.400 --> 17:49.818
How about it?

17:51.153 --> 17:52.696
Endeavor.

18:00.162 --> 18:01.455
<i>Shoto.</i>

18:02.206 --> 18:04.333
<i>Shoto, are you all right?</i>

18:05.125 --> 18:07.127
<i>Toya. Toya.</i>

18:07.711 --> 18:09.004
<i>Both of you...</i>

18:12.216 --> 18:15.594
<i>What the hell am I doing?</i>

18:16.804 --> 18:18.472
<i>Getting angry</i>

18:19.348 --> 18:22.017
<i>at All For One is illogical.</i>

18:23.393 --> 18:27.731
<i>Everything is my own doing.</i>

18:28.398 --> 18:31.902
<i>This battle... This wound...</i>

18:31.985 --> 18:33.070
<i>Everything!</i>

18:34.363 --> 18:37.991
<i>Endeavor's wound barely missed his lungs.</i>

18:38.075 --> 18:40.494
<i>My feathers are picking up
his breathing pattern.</i>

18:41.286 --> 18:42.746
<i>He'll bounce right back.</i>

18:43.497 --> 18:46.542
<i>We'll trust that he will,
and we'll move forward!</i>

18:47.960 --> 18:49.461
Tsukuyomi! Go back.

18:49.545 --> 18:50.587
Give up, Hawks.

18:50.671 --> 18:52.589
You think I shouldn't be here?

18:52.673 --> 18:54.508
The reason why I was assigned here

18:54.591 --> 18:56.009
is to provide support when the battle

18:56.093 --> 18:58.428
between the top fighters
reaches a stalemate.

18:58.512 --> 19:01.723
<i>Yes, but under the condition
that Endeavor would be here too.</i>

19:02.558 --> 19:03.725
You'll get killed!

19:03.809 --> 19:06.228
<i>Damn it. Seriously...</i>

19:07.354 --> 19:08.605
<i>I'm so pathetic.</i>

19:11.608 --> 19:14.570
Help me out once more, Hero.

19:15.112 --> 19:16.530
Of course.

19:17.531 --> 19:19.992
I don't have time

19:20.576 --> 19:23.954
to waste here,

19:24.037 --> 19:28.208
since I can't let anything bad
happen to Tomura.

19:28.792 --> 19:31.461
<i>I haven't been able
to finish Endeavor off yet.</i>

19:31.545 --> 19:33.839
<i>As long as he's alive,
he'll resume fighting.</i>

19:33.922 --> 19:37.509
<i>In that case, the objective
of these heroes during this next phase</i>

19:37.593 --> 19:39.595
<i>will be to stall for time
and wait for Endeavor.</i>

19:40.304 --> 19:43.932
<i>It's such a hassle
to be held back by two birds.</i>

19:46.059 --> 19:51.982
<i>In this current situation,
the weakest link would be...</i>

19:55.360 --> 19:57.154
Right here!

20:05.037 --> 20:06.914
Hawks.

20:11.960 --> 20:14.379
<i>I will make sure to protect them!</i>

20:14.463 --> 20:17.049
Move around as you wish, Tsukuyomi.
I have your back.

20:18.800 --> 20:20.260
Jiro, you okay?

20:21.553 --> 20:22.554
Aim for his mask.

20:23.263 --> 20:24.765
Crack it with your sound waves.

20:26.475 --> 20:29.186
<i>I was pretty sure I was ready for this.</i>

20:30.187 --> 20:31.396
<i>I didn't see that coming.</i>

20:32.731 --> 20:34.691
<i>His hatred gave me goosebumps,</i>

20:34.775 --> 20:36.652
<i>but even that response was late!</i>

20:38.195 --> 20:40.656
<i>Midoriya. Aoyama.</i>

20:41.240 --> 20:44.910
<i>This is what you've been facing
all this time, huh?</i>

20:48.205 --> 20:49.456
You're shaking.

20:50.040 --> 20:51.833
You poor thing.

20:54.336 --> 20:57.422
I guess you came here
without much thought,

20:57.506 --> 21:00.592
as if this is an extension
of your classes at school.

21:16.441 --> 21:18.527
With your paltry number of feathers,

21:18.610 --> 21:21.238
you can't possibly cut through this.

21:22.948 --> 21:24.491
Hawks,

21:24.574 --> 21:28.620
you've ended up being nothing
but an ordinary guy.

21:31.248 --> 21:34.793
It seems like the side-characters
got in a little over their heads.

21:34.876 --> 21:39.047
It just so happens that you guys
were paired with these powerhouses,

21:39.673 --> 21:41.049
so you mistakenly believed

21:41.842 --> 21:44.261
that you could fight
against the Demon King,

21:45.804 --> 21:49.474
believing you are someone special.

23:22.400 --> 23:23.568
<i>Preview of the next episode.</i>

23:24.069 --> 23:26.613
<i>Amidst the fight against All For One,</i>

23:26.696 --> 23:29.157
<i>Endeavor comes face to face
with his own weakness,</i>

23:29.908 --> 23:30.826
<i>curses it,</i>

23:30.909 --> 23:33.203
<i>and thinks back on the reason
why he strived to become a hero.</i>

23:34.621 --> 23:37.082
<i>Now is the time to counterattack.</i>

23:37.958 --> 23:41.711
<i>Next episode,
"Wounded Hero, Burning Bright and True."</i>

23:42.295 --> 23:43.922
<i>The past can't be erased,</i>

23:44.005 --> 23:46.925
<i>but... the path to the future can be paved.</i>

23:47.843 --> 23:50.345
<i>Go Beyond. Plus Ultra.</i>
